\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs22 Arnout.pro Dicommunication Tool\par
\par
This is a trusted-network PACS administration workstation. It bundles a private Python runtime, FastAPI, pynetdicom, and pydicom so a system Python install is not required.\par
\par
The web UI has no login. Do not publish the UI port to the internet. DICOM is sent in the clear unless TLS is terminated elsewhere.\par
